'''Soul''' was a {{Mythical}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costed {{Money|3,400,000}} or {{Robux|2,550}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Soul allowed the user the ability to summon souls and deal sun and thunder attacks. Soul gave the user a sun and thundercloud that allowed them to strike enemies.

Soul's removal was one of the fastest in the game, barely having been around for one update. Its attacks were nearly identical to [[Spirit]], with the Soul mechanic being much more clunkier.

