==Overview==
<tabber> 
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Every move was an AoE skill, making it a decent fruit to grind with if the user was able to manage the knockback.
* Extremely high damage.

|'''[TAP] Summon Buddies'''
* The Buddies could not be harmed but they vanished after a few seconds. The range of their perks were also not affected by the players' distance from them. (ex. If the user had a healing spirit, it will still heal them even if they were far away.
* Good for grinding.
* The Cursed Tree had auto-aim.

|'''[Z] Soul Snatcher'''
* Good stun.
* Huge hitbox.

|'''[X] Wrath of Ra'''
* This move had DoT [burning], which temporarily disabled [[Instinct]] in PvP.
* High range (when held) and high damage, comboing well into the [V] move.
* The animation created a sudden explosion, making it almost difficult for the enemy to react in time.

|'''[C] Outraged Raijin'''
* Hard to Instinct-trick.
* Long stun and large [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Quick start and low end-lag, making it a good move to "catch" people.

|'''[V] End of Times'''
* Long stun and large [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Insanely high & powerful damage, allowing the user to kill enemies with shorter combos.
* Quick start and low end-lag, making it another good move to "catch" people.
* Caused extreme screenshake to the opponent, making it almost impossible for them to see anything up until the explosion

|'''[F] Sky Ruler'''
* Good for sky camping.
* Moderately Fast.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Hard to obtain.
* Extremely high [[Mastery]] requirements for all moves.
* Moves were considered to be relatively slow.
* Damage could be unpredictable at times, due to certain parts of moves not hitting such as C's thunderbolts and X's fireballs.

|'''[TAP] Summon Buddies'''
* The possibility of spawning buddies was random, making it possible for the user to get buddies they did not want (Such as star instead of flying pig).
* Buddies were useless in [[Sea Beast]] Raids, however since all moves are AoE, this was more of a minor inconvenience.
* Toxic Mushroom was useless in PvP, since no one was going to stay inside the fog, Cursed Tree can be easily avoided by air camping or staying away.

|'''[Z] Soul Snatcher'''
* Relatively short range.
* Has end-lag.

|'''[X] Wrath of Ra'''
* Damage could be unpredictable at times, due to certain parts of moves not hitting.
* Had a visual bug that made it slightly harder for the user to land from afar, but it was easier to use when aiming under their avatar.

|'''[V] End of Times'''
* Can make the user vulnerable if missed. (But directing the beam’s explosion near them can help keep enemies away from comboing)
* The screen shaking effect affected the user's combos.

|'''[F] Sky Ruler'''
* Not recommended for use in pursuit of enemies or as a platform for aerial PvP.
}}
</tabber>

